## Third-Party Notices

kyestu includes code vendored from third-party projects:

- `packages/{log,utils,spider,render}` and `assets/migrations` are vendored from
  idol-bbq (https://github.com/ChocoLZS/idol-bbq), MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2024 ChocoLZS.
- `assets/fonts` contains fonts distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1;
  see the license files inside that directory.
- `scripts/biliup-upload.py` is a helper driving the `biliup` uploader (MIT).

The full text of the SIL Open Font License 1.1 is included in `assets/fonts/`.
